WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:32.920 --> 01:35.080
And that's another one done!

01:40.400 --> 01:42.560
All team leaders, gather your members!

01:42.560 --> 01:44.430
Use the team to get your bearings.

01:44.430 --> 01:45.960
Are you all listening?

01:48.240 --> 01:50.270
We might get some friendly fire...

01:50.270 --> 01:51.810
No!

01:51.810 --> 01:54.680
Mr. Alien!

01:54.680 --> 01:56.950
Damn, what a troublemaker.

01:56.950 --> 01:58.610
Hey, we're gonna split.

01:58.610 --> 01:59.940
Yeah.

02:06.320 --> 02:09.120
Damn it, where'd it go?

02:10.730 --> 02:13.060
Damn it...

02:13.060 --> 02:14.890
If you're up for that...

02:22.100 --> 02:23.940
Bastard...

02:23.940 --> 02:25.140
I can't see a thing!

02:25.140 --> 02:27.540
I can't contact the others, either!

02:30.450 --> 02:31.880
- Damn you!
- Ouch!

02:31.880 --> 02:34.080
Don't be so conceited!

02:36.450 --> 02:39.350
All Dread teams, do you copy?

02:39.350 --> 02:42.420
I can't read their
positions with all the noise!

02:42.420 --> 02:45.060
Initiate emergency Dread evacuation.

02:45.060 --> 02:47.360
Collect all crew still outside.

02:49.560 --> 02:51.660
What is this all of a sudden?

02:53.330 --> 02:55.560
Geez, tell us earlier.

03:01.210 --> 03:03.440
That's not who you're fighting!

03:10.250 --> 03:12.620
Serves you right!

03:12.620 --> 03:15.090
- All right, we'll go back now, too.
- Yeah!

03:29.240 --> 03:30.900
Mr. Alien!

03:34.180 --> 03:36.540
Mr. Alien, where are you?

03:36.540 --> 03:38.210
Mr. Alien!

04:00.100 --> 04:03.970
The young man still has breath in him.

04:03.970 --> 04:06.540
Oh, he has met Sam before...

04:06.540 --> 04:10.310
So he calls himself Rabat now, huh?

04:15.250 --> 04:17.550
Who are you guys?

04:18.750 --> 04:20.520
No need to worry.

04:20.520 --> 04:23.960
The spirits haven't
forsaken your folk yet.

04:23.960 --> 04:27.360
What's this?
Words are echoing in my brain...

04:28.560 --> 04:30.660
We have no need of voices.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.570
Hibiki!

04:37.570 --> 04:39.270
Please respond!

04:39.270 --> 04:42.840
Hibiki! Hibiki!

04:42.840 --> 04:45.510
No good, it's dead.

04:45.510 --> 04:48.650
Oh, I'm sorry! I meant the radar...

04:48.650 --> 04:52.720
There's too much noise,
and the sensor's no good...

04:52.720 --> 04:55.390
That's what I meant to say...

04:55.390 --> 04:58.590
Cel, don't surprise us like that!

04:58.590 --> 04:59.560
Sorry...

04:59.560 --> 05:01.300
Captain.

05:01.300 --> 05:03.830
I would like permission to go scouting...

05:03.830 --> 05:08.070
You can't see an inch in front of you.
No need to hurry out, right?

05:08.070 --> 05:10.870
There should still
be a few enemies left here.

05:10.870 --> 05:12.640
Besides...

05:12.640 --> 05:14.540
It's about that boy, right?

05:14.540 --> 05:17.750
- But don't overexert...
- Captain...

05:17.750 --> 05:21.820
Please let me go look for Mr. Alien.

05:21.820 --> 05:24.690
- Di...
- Can I use the radar room?

05:24.690 --> 05:28.560
I think it's safer to keep the
shields up with the delivery ship.

05:28.560 --> 05:32.730
If we can't combine, I think
we'll end up in more trouble later on.

05:32.730 --> 05:34.230
Everyone, calm down!

05:34.230 --> 05:36.630
We haven't decided to forsake Hibiki!

05:36.630 --> 05:38.770
There's no need to be hasty.

05:38.770 --> 05:41.700
In any case, we can't move for a while.

05:41.700 --> 05:44.370
Gather and discuss this.

05:49.610 --> 05:53.780
They don't want the boy back
just for the sake of combining.

05:53.780 --> 05:56.550
They consider him a shipmate...

05:59.520 --> 06:01.110
Of all times...

06:30.080 --> 06:33.020
Drink this.
You will feel full of power.

06:42.730 --> 06:45.300
Why don't you guys use your voices?

06:45.300 --> 06:48.140
Earthlings...

06:48.140 --> 06:49.740
Earthlings took them.

06:49.740 --> 06:51.910
Tatanka.

06:51.910 --> 06:55.540
Do not fill yourself with hatred.
Hatred leads to nothing.

06:57.380 --> 07:02.880
Our ancestors had the
means to talk to the spirits.

07:02.880 --> 07:07.720
But it could not be
explained by human technology.

07:07.720 --> 07:11.660
Earthlings, fearing us since
we surpassed their understanding...

07:11.660 --> 07:16.630
...stole our voices and
locked us away on this planet.

07:16.630 --> 07:18.970
They do really cruel things...

07:18.970 --> 07:23.100
But thanks to that,
we gained the language of the heart.

07:23.100 --> 07:26.540
We learned to speak with
the spirits more effectively.

07:26.540 --> 07:27.980
But I can't forgive 'em!

07:27.980 --> 07:29.340
Why won't you fight?

07:29.340 --> 07:31.910
You were cast away to this place!

07:31.910 --> 07:33.850
Why aren't you pissed?

07:36.280 --> 07:40.660
You have contacted the
Negative Conscience, haven't you?

07:40.660 --> 07:41.990
What's that?

07:41.990 --> 07:44.760
The Negative Conscience bears no fruit.

07:44.760 --> 07:46.930
It only destroys everything.

07:46.930 --> 07:49.960
We do not seek
fights to destroy each other.

07:49.960 --> 07:53.000
The spirits do not
lend their powers for hate.

07:53.000 --> 07:56.340
W-What's this?
A fight's a fight, right?

07:56.340 --> 07:58.110
Losing has no meaning!

07:58.110 --> 08:03.610
Victory is not always
gained from fighting.

08:03.610 --> 08:05.510
Your homeland is near

08:05.510 --> 08:10.120
and the final battle with Earth,
who seeks the harvest, is near.

08:10.120 --> 08:14.290
But that is where the
Negative Conscience slipped in.

08:14.290 --> 08:17.660
You are being hasty as a result of that.

08:17.660 --> 08:20.830
You need to speak with
your inner self once more.

08:20.830 --> 08:23.490
You should head to
the Cave of the Spirits.

08:24.770 --> 08:27.260
The Cave of the Spirits?

08:28.400 --> 08:30.610
Where we go to train our minds.

08:30.610 --> 08:32.610
The place where we speak with God.

08:32.610 --> 08:33.570
B-But...

08:33.570 --> 08:36.940
There is nothing to fear.

08:36.940 --> 08:41.680
You have already experienced
speaking with a spirit.

08:41.680 --> 08:43.340
M-Me?

08:55.900 --> 08:59.600
We finally have a grasp
of the star charts of the area.

08:59.600 --> 09:02.340
We were also able
to confirm several planets.

09:02.340 --> 09:05.370
I wonder if Mr. Alien is there?

09:05.370 --> 09:09.240
There's the chance that
he was pulled onto an asteroid.

09:09.240 --> 09:12.750
This is what you call
looking for a needle in a haystack.

09:12.750 --> 09:16.950
You try being the one
that's actually looking.

09:16.950 --> 09:20.120
I asked Bart to confirm
each and every location.

09:20.120 --> 09:22.760
I see. That's very tough work.

09:22.760 --> 09:26.560
Oh, you understand that?
But it's all right!

09:26.560 --> 09:28.900
Leave it to me!

09:28.900 --> 09:32.200
I'll make sure I find you.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.220
So don't you croak until then.

09:35.840 --> 09:37.900
Made a mistake.

09:47.050 --> 09:49.780
Geez, I can't see anything.

09:55.690 --> 09:59.790
They threw me in here with no light!

09:59.790 --> 10:01.560
Damn it, they tricked me.

10:01.560 --> 10:04.330
Fear not the darkness. Open your heart.

10:04.330 --> 10:07.300
The spirits will open
their hearts to you if you do.

10:07.300 --> 10:08.770
Quit the gibberish!

10:08.770 --> 10:11.000
I just have to climb, right?

10:12.540 --> 10:15.610
Just you watch, I'll make it to the top!

10:15.610 --> 10:18.270
Don't underestimate Hibiki the man!

10:20.880 --> 10:24.120
I lost faith in you.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.820
- What?
- It's no use!

10:25.820 --> 10:27.690
Forget it, shorty!

10:29.490 --> 10:31.230
Quit dreaming!

10:31.230 --> 10:33.030
What can you do alone?

10:33.030 --> 10:36.300
Don't you understand
other people's feelings?

10:36.300 --> 10:39.470
You're just so cute,
I couldn't help but think you were a girl.

10:39.470 --> 10:40.900
Shut up...

10:40.900 --> 10:43.970
You're not the one that's great.
It's that weapon!

10:43.970 --> 10:45.170
Shut up!

10:45.170 --> 10:48.300
I don't know who you
are but stop this silly crap!

10:50.710 --> 10:52.580
Stop it...

10:52.580 --> 10:54.240
Stop it!

11:00.490 --> 11:03.020
Chief Kokoperi...

11:03.020 --> 11:06.790
Perhaps the Warrior's Challenge
was too much for the youngster?

11:06.790 --> 11:08.000
No.

11:08.000 --> 11:11.290
It all depends on his heart.

11:17.470 --> 11:19.130
Sam!

11:23.280 --> 11:25.210
What are you doing, ribbit?

11:25.210 --> 11:27.850
I am looking at Hibiki's physical records.

11:27.850 --> 11:31.920
So I can heal him, no matter the injury.

11:31.920 --> 11:34.890
It looks rather tedious, ribbit.

11:42.160 --> 11:44.000
What are you planning to do?

11:44.000 --> 11:47.070
What is Hibiki?

11:47.070 --> 11:49.590
The proof that Hibiki is Hibiki.

11:52.340 --> 11:54.000
T-This is...

12:03.080 --> 12:08.220
It's the pointy ones
that never do anything decent.

12:08.220 --> 12:11.360
Don't talk about yourself
using someone else's words!

12:11.360 --> 12:14.060
What purpose do you have here?

12:14.060 --> 12:16.930
To show proof of your existence?

12:16.930 --> 12:18.630
What is Hibiki?

12:18.630 --> 12:21.270
Why do you exist?

12:21.270 --> 12:24.940
The proof that I am myself...

12:24.940 --> 12:27.240
I don't know...

12:27.240 --> 12:30.470
Who... Who am I?

12:35.350 --> 12:37.010
What's this?

12:53.570 --> 12:55.060
Is something wrong?

13:00.670 --> 13:02.380
Hibiki is...

13:02.380 --> 13:04.010
right here.

13:04.010 --> 13:05.410
What was that?

13:05.410 --> 13:07.050
There is no doubt.

13:07.050 --> 13:08.880
Hibiki is first generation.

13:08.880 --> 13:12.390
And he was aboard this pioneer ship.

13:12.390 --> 13:15.960
The pioneering fleet,
when leaving this current space...

13:15.960 --> 13:18.360
left only a skeleton crew

13:18.360 --> 13:21.560
and put all other crew into cold sleep.

13:21.560 --> 13:24.370
He was among them.

13:24.370 --> 13:27.230
Then that baby back then...

13:27.230 --> 13:30.500
That was the boy we know?

13:31.740 --> 13:33.570
I-Is this...

13:33.570 --> 13:35.970
me?

13:37.680 --> 13:39.340
What now?

13:43.880 --> 13:45.120
What are you doing?

13:45.120 --> 13:47.250
I don't recall an order to move.

13:47.250 --> 13:49.660
No, the ship on its own...

13:49.660 --> 13:50.660
What?

13:50.660 --> 13:52.030
Geez!

13:52.030 --> 13:54.150
Someone tell me what's going on!

13:58.930 --> 14:01.600
A gathering of carbon and hydrogen.

14:01.600 --> 14:02.600
Humans.

14:02.600 --> 14:04.000
Organisms.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.070
Men.

14:05.070 --> 14:06.910
- Women. Comrades.
- Pyoro?

14:06.910 --> 14:09.410
Even you're acting funny now?

14:09.410 --> 14:11.250
What are humans?

14:11.250 --> 14:12.880
What is Hibiki?

14:12.880 --> 14:14.820
And what are you?

14:14.820 --> 14:17.820
Are you really God? Or an illusion?

14:17.820 --> 14:23.320
Unable to comprehend.
Humans are primal organisms.

14:23.320 --> 14:25.090
I see. I get it.

14:25.090 --> 14:26.460
You're a living thing, too...

14:26.460 --> 14:28.120
aren't you?

14:30.760 --> 14:33.560
I see... So that explains it!

14:39.210 --> 14:42.800
He has arrived where the spirits await.

14:44.950 --> 14:47.150
The Blue Kachina.

14:47.150 --> 14:52.450
The 3 prayers.
The 8 shadows. The 150 hearts.

14:58.830 --> 15:02.020
Kokoperi is in the
middle of his ceremony.

15:03.500 --> 15:06.090
Sam, welcome back.

15:07.230 --> 15:10.500
I thought he would
somehow make it here.

15:10.500 --> 15:13.300
It was like this
when you first came here.

15:14.540 --> 15:18.770
He had the same look
in his eyes that you did.

15:28.190 --> 15:29.990
Stop that, Kokoperi.

15:29.990 --> 15:32.390
I'm not as simple as him.

15:32.390 --> 15:33.590
Besides...

15:33.590 --> 15:36.860
Are you saying the spirits
chose him instead of you?

15:36.860 --> 15:41.300
It is true that we saw
the Blue Kachina within him.

15:41.300 --> 15:43.300
Not just the "blue giant."

15:43.300 --> 15:47.210
He also got a hold of the
"white wings" and the "red claw."

15:47.210 --> 15:52.950
If that is the will of the universe,
then he will surely overcome

15:52.950 --> 15:56.040
the challenge called himself.

16:02.020 --> 16:05.130
The ticking of time. Lives with limits.

16:05.130 --> 16:08.760
You don't have what you
call the ticking of time, right?

16:08.760 --> 16:11.070
But humans have it.

16:11.070 --> 16:15.900
From your viewpoint,
we may really be primal organisms.

16:15.900 --> 16:20.040
But that's why we cherish this day,
this time as we live.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.540
What is Hibiki?

16:21.540 --> 16:23.510
Why does he exist?

16:23.510 --> 16:25.750
I don't know the answer, either.

16:25.750 --> 16:29.350
But I live on to find the answer.

16:29.350 --> 16:32.220
That is Hibiki's proof.

16:32.220 --> 16:36.720
No, I hate to say this,
but I can't live by myself.

16:36.720 --> 16:40.190
I barely live on,
supported by tons of others.

16:40.190 --> 16:43.300
Those are comrades. Valuable things.

16:43.300 --> 16:44.500
That's right.

16:44.500 --> 16:46.870
They go too far out of their way...

16:46.870 --> 16:51.070
but because they're here,
I can stay myself.

16:51.070 --> 16:53.140
It's no good if I lose even one!

16:53.140 --> 16:55.710
I no longer become myself.

16:55.710 --> 16:59.950
Desires of many. Prayers. Hope.

16:59.950 --> 17:01.920
It's too big for me.

17:01.920 --> 17:06.520
But I can't come to really give up on it.

17:06.520 --> 17:10.320
For them...
When I think that they'll be sad...

17:10.320 --> 17:12.930
I can't take it easy.

17:12.930 --> 17:16.260
Worry. Doubt. Jealousy.

17:16.260 --> 17:20.470
Until recently,
I only thought about myself.

17:20.470 --> 17:25.570
That's why I never cared
what the people around me thought.

17:25.570 --> 17:28.510
But now I know.

17:28.510 --> 17:30.440
They're on my mind.

17:30.440 --> 17:32.310
If I'm stronger than now.

17:32.310 --> 17:34.580
If I have more power than now...

17:34.580 --> 17:37.220
I can save everyone.

17:37.220 --> 17:41.220
When I think about that,
I can't ever run away!

17:41.220 --> 17:45.990
I really feel in my heart that
I want to be stronger for them.

17:50.930 --> 17:52.590
Don't get in my way!

17:54.640 --> 17:57.340
I won't run away!

17:57.340 --> 18:01.440
Even if I'm like this,
there are people that believe in me...

18:01.440 --> 18:04.110
For them...

18:04.110 --> 18:08.180
To protect them, I will fight!

18:08.180 --> 18:10.120
That is the circle of life.

18:10.120 --> 18:11.920
The proof of life.

18:11.920 --> 18:13.290
That's right!

18:13.290 --> 18:18.690
And this is the proof that I am alive!

18:24.130 --> 18:28.000
The birth of another true warrior.

18:32.240 --> 18:34.910
That young boy is in
the center of the universe!

18:34.910 --> 18:37.240
Is this also the will of the spirits?

18:38.810 --> 18:42.450
You're standing on your own stage now.

18:42.450 --> 18:44.990
Raise your voice and introduce yourself!

18:44.990 --> 18:47.420
Use your own words!

18:54.730 --> 18:57.100
I am Hibiki Tokai!

18:57.100 --> 19:00.200
I will fight! I will never run away!

19:00.200 --> 19:03.530
For the people that believe in me!

19:08.510 --> 19:10.170
Mr. Alien!

19:20.090 --> 19:22.060
Oh, stop it!

19:25.090 --> 19:26.260
Geez...

19:26.260 --> 19:29.330
To think it really was a living creature.

19:29.330 --> 19:32.030
That surprised even me.

19:32.030 --> 19:34.000
Space is a vast place.

19:34.000 --> 19:37.440
Far superior to our limited imagination.

19:37.440 --> 19:40.810
Well, it'll be nice
to keep working with you, Paksis!

19:40.810 --> 19:43.040
But now that I know it's alive...

19:43.040 --> 19:46.780
I need your help from now on, Doctor.

19:46.780 --> 19:50.940
Because it won't be "repairs,"
but "treatment" from now on.

19:52.750 --> 19:55.490
You have a point.

19:55.490 --> 19:59.550
You still say interesting things.

20:01.900 --> 20:05.000
I smell something.
It's been a while, but check!

20:05.000 --> 20:08.020
She's still the same old, same old...

20:16.010 --> 20:18.310
Young lad, you have been reborn.

20:18.310 --> 20:22.750
You met the challenge well.
You are a noble warrior.

20:22.750 --> 20:24.280
Stop that.

20:24.280 --> 20:27.780
I feel embarrassed after
making such a scene before.

20:30.990 --> 20:37.130
As long as you have this stone,
we are always with you.

20:37.130 --> 20:41.770
You have overcome this
land's challenge and were reborn.

20:41.770 --> 20:45.860
This planet is your
new homeland from today.

20:47.710 --> 20:50.110
You can come back here anytime.

20:50.110 --> 20:52.580
In hard times or happy times...

20:52.580 --> 20:56.080
we will always greet you.

20:56.080 --> 20:58.120
No need to hesitate.

20:58.120 --> 21:02.190
Because we are your family now.

21:02.190 --> 21:03.720
My...

21:03.720 --> 21:05.390
family.

21:13.130 --> 21:14.790
Thanks.

21:16.440 --> 21:20.740
Once we're past this storm,
it's finally our homeland!

21:20.740 --> 21:23.340
Everyone, don't let your guard down!

21:23.340 --> 21:25.000
Roger!
